sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Student
  participant Page as Payment Page (Web App)
  participant Api as API
  participant Db as Database (PostgreSQL)
  participant Pay as Payment Gateway
  participant Notif as Notification Service
  Note over Student,Notif: Key - solid arrow = synchronous call, open arrowhead = asynchronous message, dashed arrow = reply, alt = branch, opt = optional step

  %% Student starts payment for an APPROVED request
  Student->>Page: Tap "Pay now" on approved request
  activate Page
  Page->>Api: POST /api/orders/{id}/payments
  activate Api
  Api->>Db: SELECT order WHERE id and student_id
  activate Db
  Db-->>Api: order (status APPROVED)
  deactivate Db

  alt status is APPROVED (valid)
    Api->>Db: INSERT payment (PENDING)
    activate Db
    Db-->>Api: payment id
    deactivate Db
    Api->>Pay: Create payment for amount and payment id
    activate Pay
    Pay-->>Api: Checkout link
    deactivate Pay
    Api-->>Page: 200 OK with checkout link
    Page-->>Student: Redirect to gateway checkout

    %% Student pays on the gateway's own page
    Student->>Pay: Enter payment details and confirm
    activate Pay
    Pay-->>Student: Show payment result page
    deactivate Pay

    %% Gateway reports the result later
    Pay-)Api: POST /api/webhooks/payment with PAID or FAILED
    alt payment PAID
      Api->>Db: UPDATE payment PAID, order QUEUED with queue number, INSERT notification
      activate Db
      Db-->>Api: committed
      deactivate Db
      Note over Api,Db: Status and queue number are committed BEFORE any notification is attempted
      Api-)Notif: Send "Payment confirmed, your queue number is A-014" (async)
      Notif-)Student: Notification delivered
      Api-->>Pay: 200 OK
    else payment FAILED
      Api->>Db: UPDATE payment FAILED (order stays APPROVED)
      activate Db
      Db-->>Api: updated
      deactivate Db
      Api-)Notif: Send "Payment failed, please try again" (async)
      Notif-)Student: Notification delivered
      Api-->>Pay: 200 OK
    end
  else status is not APPROVED (invalid)
    Api-->>Page: 409 Conflict (order not awaiting payment)
    Page-->>Student: Show "This request cannot be paid now"
  end
  deactivate Api
  deactivate Page
